PeerPane is a Humatic AI product. Humatic AI, Planet 9, BlogPilot, and PeerPane
are names used by Humatic AI.

This product includes software developed from nanobrowser
(https://github.com/nanobrowser/nanobrowser), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

Changes from upstream nanobrowser:
- Rebranded as Humatic AI PeerPane Browser Extension (name, logos, and
  user-facing copy).
- Replaced the default multi-agent browser-automation chat path with a Humatic AI
  chat client that streams against the public X-API-Key API
  (POST /chat/stream).
- Added Humatic AI connection settings (API key, base URL) and optional
  "attach current page" context (screenshot + page text).
- The original Planner/Navigator executor remains in the codebase for a later
  automation stage but is not the primary chat path.

